# Self-hosting: point this deployment at your own league dataset instead of
# forking data/*.json. Must be a URL returning one JSON file shaped
# { league, teams, matches } — see src/utils/datasetOverride.ts for the
# exact shape and validation rules. A raw.githubusercontent.com link to a
# file your own scraper commits works well; the URL must allow cross-origin
# requests (CORS).
#
# Leave unset to use the data baked into data/*.json (the default demo league).
VITE_DATA_SOURCE_URL=
